/* 글과 시는 모두 이 앱을 위해 새로 지은 것 (옛이야기는 줄거리만 쉽게 다시 씀) */
const kc = (key, type, prompt, o) => Object.assign({ key:'k:' + key, subj:'kor', type, prompt, say:prompt, input:'choice', cols:1 }, o, { opts:shuffle(o.opts) });
const kox = (key, stmt, ans, hint, explain) => kc('ox:' + key, 'ox', '맞으면 O, 틀리면 X를 골라요', { say:stmt + '. 맞으면 오, 틀리면 엑스', read:stmt, vis:{ k:'html', html:`<div class="sent text-q">${esc(stmt)}</div>` }, opts:['O','X'], ans, cols:2, big:true, hint, explain:explain || `${stmt} → ${ans}` });
const passHTML = t => `<div class="passage">${esc(t).replace(/\n/g, '<br>')}</div>`;
const blankSent = s => `<div class="sent text-q">${esc(s).replace('___', '<span class="blank">&nbsp;</span>')}</div>`;
/* [문제, 정답, 오답, 오답] 꼴 묶음에서 하나 */
const kpick = (key, type, list, hint, extra = {}) => { const [p, a, w1, w2, h] = pick(list); return kc(key + p, type, p, Object.assign({ opts:[a, w1, w2], ans:a, hint:h || hint, explain:a }, extra)); };
const ro = w => { const d = dec(w[w.length - 1]); return w + (d && d[2] && d[2] !== 8 ? '으로' : '로'); };
const DOUBLE_FIN = new Set([3, 5, 6, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 18]);
const hasDoubleBatchim = w => [...w].some(ch => { const d = dec(ch); return d && DOUBLE_FIN.has(d[2]); });

